1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,197
This love in my heart,
it will burn on forever.

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:09,037
Granting me courage, I
hope it will never stop.

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:12,177
No matter where you
are, nothing is too far.

4
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:15,857
With our everlasting bones,
we'll reach it, we are home.

5
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:22,637
I'm

6
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,917
so truly grateful.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,800
I ran into you on that day so long ago.

8
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,397
We laughed every moment
with tears in our eyes.

9
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:34,860
Till we knew we weren't alone.

10
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:41,820
The blowing wind came in
and joined us on our way.

11
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:47,097
And with it I know we'll rise.

12
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:49,797
We'll be flying up high.

13
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:52,920
Why, tell me why are you giving up?

14
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:56,160
Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?

15
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:59,620
Hey, what kind of future
do you think you have?

16
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:03,197
Your dream is already in your hands.

17
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:06,917
This love in my heart,
it will burn off forever.

18
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,757
Granting me courage, I
hope it will never stop.

19
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:13,897
I don't matter where you
are, nothing is too far.

20
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:16,457
With our everlasting
plans, we'll reach it.

21
00:01:16,540 --> 00:01:20,517
We are home from the horizon
out on the edge of the world.

22
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:23,497
If there is a place that
I want to take you to?

23
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:24,897
Let's head for it then!

24
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:28,540
But as for the way we already know.

25
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,620
We promised it long ago.

26
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:45,317
You scream by your voice.

27
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:47,257
That can't break through the silence.

28
00:01:47,340 --> 00:01:48,817
Feeling defeated.

29
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:51,037
It crushes your helpless heart.

30
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,697
I've got your back, I swear.

31
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:54,177
I'll always be here.

32
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:58,100
Let's put our fate within
this light under the sun.

33
00:01:58,940 --> 00:02:02,880
Can you close your eyes and
just listen to my voice?

34
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:04,897
Let's find the answer together.

35
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:07,597
I'm telling you in our path.

36
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,617
I trust that it will lead us.

37
00:02:09,700 --> 00:02:11,517
To another sea untarded.

38
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,437
Cause now we are home.

39
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:16,197
On the horizon, out on
the edge of the world.

40
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:19,197
There is a place that
I want to take you to.

41
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,717
Let's head for it then.

42
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:24,240
But as for the way, we already know.

43
00:02:25,380 --> 00:02:27,360
We promised it long ago.

44
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:52,990
Ahhhhhhhhhhh!

45
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:55,710
Yeahhhhhhh!

46
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:58,238
They are developing extremely quick.

47
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:01,242
All four of these children
have incredible skill.

48
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:04,240
