not to ask questions about it.

58
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:57,530
All right.

59
00:04:33,140 --> 00:04:33,970
Sanji!

60
00:04:35,100 --> 00:04:38,340
I thought I told you royalty
doesn't serve anyone!

61
