She's dead, and you know that!

62
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:43,655
So stop trying to be like your mother!

63
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:57,857
What happened are you all right there

64
00:04:57,940 --> 00:05:02,117
master Sanji huh his majesty ordered

65
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:08,340
us not to allow you into the kitchen
oh please I beg you let me stay

66
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:20,750
Ha ha!

67
00:05:20,833 --> 00:05:21,820
All finished!

68
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:34,718
Where are you going all by yourself?

69
00:05:34,860 --> 00:05:36,100
To see my mother.

70
00:05:36,460 --> 00:05:37,917
But the weather is awful!

71
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:41,320
And the medical ward is so
far! I'm fine! But wait!

72
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:42,780
Stop following me!

73
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,440
Don't tell my dad, okay?

74
00:06:00,180 --> 00:06:01,900
Take shelter now!

75
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:20,100
Go away, dog!

76
00:06:20,340 --> 00:06:21,817
I didn't make this food for you!

77
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:22,730
No!

78
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:44,920
Oh!

79
00:06:50,420 --> 00:06:53,260
Oh, Master Sanji, you came here alone?

80
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:02,660
This was very thoughtful of you, my dear.

81
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:06,567
But I worry a meal like this
will upset Her Majesty's stomach.

82
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:13,560
Although, maybe it doesn't
taste as bad as it looks.

83
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:37,400
Sanji, it's pouring, and
you still came to see me?

84
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:40,565
Your father will be so
furious if he finds out.

85
00:07:41,340 --> 00:07:42,620
Hear, your majesty.

86
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:45,540
He brought this for you.

87
00:07:50,220 --> 00:07:52,279
Sweetheart, did you make this food?

88
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:58,750
Ebony?

89
00:07:59,460 --> 00:08:00,813
