90
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:02,400
Don't be presumptuous.

91
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:06,000
Please bring me the food
Sanji really made at once.

92
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,360
Well, I would,

93
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:12,297
but you see, it got ruined on the way
over here and there was no salvaging it.

94
00:08:12,380 --> 00:08:13,797
So I threw it away.

95
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:14,940
Bring it in right.

96
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:20,820
Look at that!

97
00:08:21,380 --> 00:08:25,200
There's omelet rolls with
some fish and a banana, too.

98
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,360
Oh, mom.

99
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:29,160
I'm sorry I messed it up.

100
00:08:29,420 --> 00:08:32,080
I was running and I tripped in the street.

101
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:36,420
It got smooshed and it's
all soggy, too Let's try

102
00:08:43,060 --> 00:08:44,020
Yummy!

103
00:08:48,980 --> 00:08:51,120
Really? Really?

104
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,040
Thanks, Mom!

105
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:57,220
Will you cook for me some more?

106
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,717
I... I...

107
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:18,277
I...

108
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,780
I miss you both!

109
00:09:22,680 --> 00:09:25,680
Will you cook for me some more?

110
00:09:40,260 --> 00:09:42,848
You want me to bring
you stuff to cook with?

111
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:12,640
The all-blue, a place with
fish from all four seas,

112
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,940
legendary waters.

113
