Look at that, told you, it's him.

114
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:27,340
Right, that is Sanji.

115
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:29,020
He's still alive, huh?

116
00:10:29,380 --> 00:10:32,204
But why would Dad lie
about something like that?

117
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:34,280
Because he wishes he was dead.

118
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:42,040
Hey, if Sanji really did die, I wonder if
Dad would be happy when he heard the news.

119
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:56,510
Hahaha!

120
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:06,440
Let me go.

121
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:11,660
You've always been a failure, Sanji.

122
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,340
You deserve to die.

123
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,520
You suck.

124
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:32,977
Don't think I'm on your side
just because I patched you up.

125
00:11:33,060 --> 00:11:34,413
I'm not involved, okay?

126
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,489
Those three don't get sad.

127
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:38,642
They never feel sympathy either.

128
00:11:39,300 --> 00:11:43,712
Father thinks they're such great fighters
because they don't have emotions.

129
