My body has some physical modifications,
too, but I actually have emotions.

130
00:11:51,580 --> 00:11:52,410
Bye.

131
00:11:52,780 --> 00:11:54,940
Um, thanks for helping me again.

132
00:11:56,220 --> 00:12:00,000
