147
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:20,400
If I can just run away somehow,

148
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:25,777
while we're in the East Blue,

149
00:14:25,860 --> 00:14:31,100
then I'll be free, right?

150
00:14:31,580 --> 00:14:36,540
I can live the rest of my life
without ever seeing Dad's face again.

151
00:14:46,380 --> 00:14:47,500
Back away!

152
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,900
You only get one chance!

153
00:14:54,340 --> 00:14:56,040
So try not to mess it up!

154
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:05,540
Attack now!

155
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:18,517
The fight just started.

156
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:21,437
Father's hiding the key to
your mask in his bedroom,

157
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:23,417
so you need to go in
there and get it quickly.

158
00:15:23,500 --> 00:15:24,330
What?

159
00:15:24,413 --> 00:15:27,097
I'll check outside to see if
it's safe enough for you to go.

160
00:15:27,180 --> 00:15:28,680
Okay, yeah.

161
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:31,257
As soon as you get to father's room,

162
00:15:31,340 --> 00:15:34,257
look for a symbol on the
wall that looks like a skull.

163
00:15:34,340 --> 00:15:36,752
That's where you'll find the secret door.

164
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:53,390
Gotcha!

165
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:56,280
