169
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:10,470
Father!

170
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:18,612
I'm going to leave this wretched kingdom,

171
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:21,660
and no one's getting in
my way, not even you!

172
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:25,904
You've developed quite an attitude
since you've been locked away.

173
00:16:26,620 --> 00:16:29,120
You're normal, and that makes you weak.

174
00:16:29,740 --> 00:16:34,034
There's not a sea in this entire world
where you can survive on your own.

175
00:16:35,100 --> 00:16:36,020
You'll die.

176
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:47,837
yes what you still can't
stop me I wouldn't want

177
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:53,677
to it feels strange to
admit this but I suppose I

178
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:57,077
am human after all even
though my son is useless

179
00:16:57,160 --> 00:17:00,877
I can't bring myself to
kill him but you're saying

180
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:02,377
you'll go away voluntarily

181
00:17:02,460 --> 00:17:08,117
i won't stop you then

182
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:11,357
and i'll gladly let you
have the key to that iron

183
00:17:11,440 --> 00:17:18,257
mask listen sanji before

184
00:17:18,340 --> 00:17:19,737
you and i part ways for

185
00:17:19,820 --> 00:17:22,761
the last time there is
something i must ask of you

186
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:28,820
No matter what,

187
00:17:29,020 --> 00:17:34,640
if anyone ever asks about your family, you
must never tell them who your father is.

188
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:45,037
Having you as a son is my greatest shame.

189
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:47,020
You must know that.

190
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:20,840
I don't know.

191
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,537
What about the cruise ship at the port?

192
00:18:38,620 --> 00:18:40,237
It's got nothing to do with us.

193
00:18:40,320 --> 00:18:42,157
They were just unlucky to be here.

194
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:43,070
Let them be.

195
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,960
You need to board that ship.

196
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:49,600
Come on, Sanji.

197
00:18:49,820 --> 00:18:51,680
Stop crying like a little baby.

198
00:18:53,940 --> 00:18:54,820
Look!

199
00:18:55,020 --> 00:18:57,432
You can never come back here, understand?

200
00:19:01,100 --> 00:19:02,620
You'll be okay!

201
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,260
I swear!

202
00:19:06,260 --> 00:19:08,257
The sea is really big.

203
00:19:08,340 --> 00:19:11,120
You will meet nice
people out there someday.

204
00:19:15,080 --> 00:19:16,397
Now go!

205
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,520
And don't look back!

206
00:19:23,820 --> 00:19:25,760
Run away!

207
