when you're doubled over in pain.

245
00:23:03,720 --> 00:23:05,780
No, I'm never gonna give up.

246
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:09,840
I'm gonna eat and eat and then
I'll go rescue Soji. That's so.

247
00:23:10,100 --> 00:23:12,957
